{'symbol': 'JNJ', 'date': '2022-11-30 17:00:00', 'title': 'JOHNSON & JOHNSON NAMES CEO JOAQUIN DUATO AS CHAIRMAN OF THE BOARD', 'text': 'NEW BRUNSWICK, N.J.--( BUSINESS WIRE )--JOHNSON & JOHNSON (NYSE: JNJ) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT ITS BOARD OF DIRECTORS HAS ELECTED CHIEF EXECUTIVE OFFICER, MR. JOAQUIN DUATO, TO ASSUME THE ADDITIONAL POSITION OF CHAIRMAN, EFFECTIVE IN JANUARY 2023. MR. DUATO SUCCEEDS MR. ALEX GORSKY, WHO WILL STEP DOWN FROM HIS ROLE AS EXECUTIVE CHAIRMAN FOLLOWING A BRIEF TRANSITIONAL PERIOD.'}